---
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Visitor credits · After Hours</title></head>
<body><main><a href="/">← Back to the diner</a><h1>Friends at the door.</h1><p>A small thank-you to the artists behind our surprise visitors. Game characters belong to their respective owners.</p>
{credits.map(credit => <article><h2>{credit.name}</h2><p><a href={credit.source}>{credit.name}</a> · {credit.artist}{credit.license === 'CC BY 4.0' && <> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a></>}</p><p>{credit.changes}</p>{credit.license === 'Beerware' && <p>This work is released under the Beerware license. As long as you retain this notice you can do whatever you want with this stuff. If you and the author meet some day, and you think this stuff is worth it, you can buy the author a beer in return.</p>}</article>)}
<article><h2>A knock at the door.</h2><p><a href="https://freesound.org/people/Islabonita/sounds/541492/">Knocking_Wooden_Door.wav</a> · Islabonita · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0</a></p><p>Trimmed to three knocks with a softened tail; encoded for the web.</p></article>
</main></body></html>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#1b211e;color:#e1d4b8;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.7}main{max-width:640px;margin:12vh auto;padding:28px}h1,h2{font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-weight:400}h1{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:.3em}h2{font-size:2rem}article{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid #e1d4b830}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}p{opacity:.8}</style>
